+/// Aggregate globals (a struct or array of function-constant-derived fields, e.g. Core Animation's
+/// `fc_fragment_shader_config`) whose loads may be folded to what the static initializer stored into them.
+#[derive(Clone, Debug, Default)]
+pub(crate) struct StaticInitAggregates {
+    /// The static initializer function (its stores are the only writes to `globals`).
+    pub(crate) initializer: String,
+    /// Internal, non-constant aggregate globals that the initializer writes only through constant addresses and that
+    /// every other function only reads: through loads, or through `select`/`getelementptr` chains ending in loads.
