+/// Remember which element of a descriptor array each `&param[k]` chain addresses, before the
+/// chains are retired as dead: the element pointers only reach their consumers through memory
+/// (ANGLE keeps `thread T *texture` in a local struct), where the sidecar facts name them by id.
+fn record_array_element_pointers(ctx: &mut Ctx, entry_idx: usize, param: Word, var: Word) {
